#: .\AQY\templates\AQY\AQYhelp.html:216 .\CNS\templates\CNS\CNShelp.html:200
#: .\KFW\templates\KFW\KFWhelp.html:444
msgid "You can resign during your \\"
msgstr "你可以在你的 \\ 阶段认输"

