#: .\AQY\templates\AQY\AQYstats.html:16
msgid "Antiquity Stats"
msgstr "中世纪 统计"

#: .\AQY\templates\AQY\AQYstats.html:18 .\IND\templates\IND\INDstats.html:18
#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZstats.html:18
msgid "Back to Main Stats"
msgstr "返回主统计"

#: .\AQY\templates\AQY\AQYstats.html:27 .\IND\templates\IND\INDstats.html:25
#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZstats.html:27
msgid "Finished games"
msgstr "已完成游戏"

#: .\AQY\templates\AQY\AQYstats.html:31 .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZstats.html:39
msgid ""
"Any game with a resigned/kicked player is not considered for these stats."
msgstr "有认输/被踢玩家的对局不计入这些统计。"

#: .\AQY\templates\AQY\AQYstats.html:34
msgid ""
"These are historical stats. They show what has happened in previous games, "
"but Antiquity still rewards reading and responding to the current game state."
msgstr "这些是历史统计，反映以往对局情况，但 中世纪 仍奖励读懂并响应当前局势。"

#: .\AQY\templates\AQY\AQYstats.html:36
msgid "Saint Statistics"
msgstr "圣人统计"

#: .\AQY\templates\AQY\AQYstats.html:37
msgid ""
"Select a player count to compare how often each saint was available, picked, "
"and won."
msgstr "选择人数，比较每位圣人可选、被选与获胜的频率。"

#: .\AQY\templates\AQY\AQYstats.html:40 .\IND\templates\IND\INDstats.html:49
#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\stats.html:75 .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZstats.html:54
msgid "2 Player"
msgstr "2 人游戏"

#: .\AQY\templates\AQY\AQYstats.html:41 .\IND\templates\IND\INDstats.html:50
#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\stats.html:76 .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZstats.html:55
msgid "3 Player"
msgstr "3 人游戏"

#: .\AQY\templates\AQY\AQYstats.html:42 .\IND\templates\IND\INDstats.html:51
#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\stats.html:77 .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZstats.html:56
msgid "4 Player"
msgstr "4 人游戏"

#: .\AQY\templates\AQY\AQYstats.html:43
msgid "Combined"
msgstr "合计"

#: .\AQY\templates\AQY\AQYstats.html:196 .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZstats.html:202
msgid "In this stats table, a 'picked' game includes both 'lost' and 'won'"
msgstr "在此统计表中，'已选'包含'负'与'胜'"

#: .\AQY\templates\AQY\AQYstats.html:198 .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZstats.html:204
msgid "Click a cell to see the games"
msgstr "点击单元格查看游戏"

#: .\AQY\templates\AQY\AQYstats.html:202
msgid "Saint"
msgstr "圣人"

#: .\AQY\templates\AQY\AQYstats.html:203
msgid "Turns to Win"
