msgstr "创建免费账号"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:116
msgid "Log in"
msgstr "登录"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:121
msgid "What you get"
msgstr "你会得到"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:124
msgid "Live multiplayer"
msgstr "实时多人"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:125
msgid ""
"Games update instantly between players. Get notified when it's your turn."
msgstr "游戏在玩家之间实时更新。轮到你时会收到通知。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:128
msgid "Practice solo"
msgstr "单人训练"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:129
msgid ""
"Start a hot-seat game and play every seat on a single device to learn the "
"rules."
msgstr "在同一台设备上轮流扮演所有席位，开始热座游戏以学习规则。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:132
msgid "Stats & rewind"
msgstr "统计与回退"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:133
msgid ""
"Review past moves, study other players' strategies, and track your stats "
"over time."
msgstr "回顾过往走法，研究其他玩家的策略，并长期跟踪你的统计数据。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:136
