#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\tournamentsHelp.html:8
#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\tournaments\AllMainTournaments.html:23
#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\tournaments\AllMiniTournaments.html:24
msgid "Tournaments"
msgstr "锦标赛"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:137
msgid ""
"Join open tournaments by skill bracket or community-run mini tournaments."
msgstr "参加按水平分组的公开锦标赛，或社区举办的迷你锦标赛。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:142
msgid "Games available"
msgstr "可用游戏"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:143
msgid "Click a game card to read more about it."
msgstr "点击游戏卡片查看更多。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:145
msgid ""
"Build a fast-food empire by out-advertising and out-producing your rivals."
msgstr "通过超越对手的广告与生产，建立你的快餐帝国。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:146
msgid ""
"Race rivals to build and sell the most automobiles in a brand-new market."
msgstr "在全新市场中与对手竞速，建造并销售最多汽车。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:147
msgid ""
"Raise monuments to your chosen god across an ancient African trade network."
msgstr "在古代非洲贸易网络中为你所选神祇升起纪念碑。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:148
msgid "Grow cities and please your patron saint before the land is depleted."
msgstr "在土地耗尽前发展城市并取悦你的守护圣人。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:149
msgid "Ship goods, merge companies, and dominate an emerging economy."
msgstr "运输货物、合并公司，主宰新兴经济。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:150
msgid "Carry passengers across an expanding city — with time itself in play."
msgstr "在不断扩张的城市中运送乘客 — 时间本身也参与其中。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:151
msgid "Produce films and work the network to win Cannes."
msgstr "制作影片并经营人脉网络以赢得 Cannes。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:152
msgid "Connect computers, lay cable, and outmanoeuvre your opponents."
msgstr "连接电脑、铺设线缆，智胜对手。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:153
msgid ""
"Build a civilisation by logistics and transport — there is no territory."
msgstr "以物流与运输建立文明 — 没有领土概念。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:154
msgid "Bid for village tiles and use workers across four seasons."
msgstr "竞标村庄板块，在四季中使用工人。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:157
msgid "About the games"
msgstr "关于游戏"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:162
msgid ""
"Build up your fast food empire by out advertising and out producing your "
"opponents to win the match"
msgstr "通过超越对手的广告宣传和生产能力，建立起你的快餐帝国，赢得商业胜利"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:165
#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:184
#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:201
#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:216
#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:231
#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:246
#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:263
#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:278
#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:293
msgid ""
"From <a href=\"https://www.splottershop.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Splotter's</"
"a> website:"
msgstr ""
"来自 <a href=\"https://www.splottershop.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Splotter</"
"a> 网站："

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:170
msgid ""
"Food Chain Magnate is a heavy strategy game about building a fast food "
"chain. The focus is on building your company using a card-driven (human) "
"resource management system. Players compete on a variable city map through "
"purchasing, marketing and sales, and on a job market for key staff members."
msgstr ""
"Food Chain Magnate 是一款关于建立快餐连锁的重度策略游戏。重点是用卡牌驱动的人"
"力资源管理系统建设公司。玩家在可变城市版图上通过采购、营销与销售，以及在关键"
"员工的人才市场上竞争。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:173
msgid ""
"Includes options for all expansion modules. Play with 2-6 people or start a "
"practice game to play as all players on one device."
msgstr ""
"包含全部扩展模组选项。与 2-6 人游玩，或开始训练游戏在同一设备上控制所有玩家。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:181
msgid ""
"Build your civilisation through logistics and transport - manage goods, "
"roads, boats and more to outproduce your rivals"
msgstr "通过物流与运输建立你的文明——管理货物、道路、船只等，以产量压倒对手"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:189
msgid ""
"In Roads & Boats, each player builds a civilisation over a long period of "
"time, like in many other games. Unlike most games, however, the emphasis is "
"not on warfare, population growth, city or statebuilding, but on logistics, "
"or rather: on transport. Each player starts the game with three donkeys, a "
"pile of wooden boards, a number of stones and two geese. With these few "
"resources, you try to build such diverse things as woodcutters, roads, "
"boats, mines, a stock exchange... but beware! There is no concept of "
"territory in this game: you cannot own land, nor will you ever keep it. "
"Before you know it, someone else might settle in your place and take over "
"your hard work!"
msgstr ""
"在《路与船》中，每位玩家像在许多其他游戏中一样，经年累月建立自己的文明。然而"
"与大多数游戏不同，重点不在战争、人口增长、城市建设或国家建设，而在物流，或者"
"更准确地说：运输。每位玩家开局只有三头驴、一堆木板、若干石头和两只鹅。凭借这"
"些少量资源，你试图建造伐木场、道路、船只、矿场、交易所等各种东西——但要小心！"
"本游戏没有领土概念：你不能拥有土地，也永远保不住它。不知不觉间，别人可能就在"
"你的地盘定居并夺走你的劳动成果！"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:191
msgid ""
"Play with 2-6 people or solo, or start a practice game to play as all "
"players on one device."
msgstr "与 2-6 人或单人游玩，或开始训练游戏在同一设备上控制所有玩家。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:198
msgid ""
"Compete to build and sell the most vehicles - research and influence the "
"market to forge your path to victory"
msgstr "通过建造，研究和销售更多汽车，影响市场，开辟通往胜利的道路"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:206
msgid ""
"Horseless Carriage is a game about the dawn of the automobile: a time when "
"cars were invented, and no one quite knew yet what this new contraption "
"would look like, and what features would be essential. Early cars sometimes "
"used levers or pedals to steer and a wheel to accelerate. Brakes were not "
"always seen as essential; but sometimes an outside spot to take along an "
"onboard mechanic was. This early, super innovative period occurs in the "
"development of many new product categories. Players are cast as aspiring "
"industrialists trying to find out what features the public will value when "
"buying these new, expensive, and utterly unfamiliar horseless carriages."
msgstr ""
"Horseless Carriage 是一款关于汽车黎明时期的游戏：汽车刚被发明时，没人确切知道"
"这新装置会长什么样、哪些功能必不可少。早期汽车有时用杆或踏板转向、用轮加速。"
"刹车并非总是被视为必需；有时反而需要额外位置带上随车机械师。许多新产品门类都"
"有这样早期超创新阶段。玩家扮演有抱负的实业家，试图弄清公众在购买这些全新、昂"
"贵且完全陌生的无马马车时会看重哪些功能。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:208
#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:270
msgid ""
"Play with 3-5 people or start a practice game to play as all players on one "
"device."
msgstr "可以与3-5个人一起玩，或者进行训练游戏，在同一台设备上进行所有行动。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:214
msgid ""
"Raise your monuments to establish your empire as having the best mythology"
msgstr "升起你的纪念碑，确立你的帝国拥有最好的神话"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:221
msgid ""
"The Great Zimbabwe is a game about building a trade based civilization in "
"ancient Africa. It has been inspired by the old kingdoms surrounding the "
"Great Zimbabwe, a world heritage site in southern Africa. As always in our "
"games, we have used this history for inspiration; however, first and "
"foremost we wanted to create a highly playable and replayable Splotter game, "
"so in many cases we took liberties with historical names, periods and "
"artwork. In the game, players strive to build the most impressive monuments "
"to one god of their choice. They can choose this god themselves - each of "
"the twelve gods offers a unique blessing, but each also requires a different "
"amount of work to win the game. Building the monuments is done by developing "
"a logistics network stretching across the region. Through this network, "
"players produce and obtain ritual goods to raise their monuments and bring "
"honour to the god of their choice."
msgstr ""
"《大津巴布韦》是一款关于在古代非洲建立贸易文明的游戏，灵感来自南非世界遗产大"
"津巴布韦周边的古老王国。一如我们游戏的一贯风格，我们以这段历史为灵感；但首先"
"我们想要创造一款可玩性与重玩性都很高的 Splotter 游戏，因此许多地方我们对历史"
"名称、时期和美术做了自由发挥。游戏中，玩家力求为自己选择的神建造最壮观的纪念"
"碑。神由玩家自选——十二位神各有独特祝福，但也各自需要不同的工作量才能获胜。建"
"造纪念碑要靠横跨整个区域的物流网络。通过该网络，玩家生产和获取仪式用品，以抬"
"起纪念碑并为所选之神带来荣耀。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:223
#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:238
msgid ""
"Play with 2-5 people or start a practice game to play as all players on one "
"device."
msgstr "与 2-5 人一起玩，或开始训练游戏在同一设备上控制所有玩家。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:229
msgid "Ship your goods as efficiently as possible to dominate the economy!"
msgstr "以最高效率运送货物，主宰经济！"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:236
msgid ""
"Indonesia is a game in which two to five players build up an economy, trying "
"to acquire the most money. Players acquire production companies and shipping "
"companies, which deliver goods to cities. As cities receive goods, they "
"grow, increasing their demands. Production companies earn money for each "
"good delivered to a city, up to the city's capacity, but they must pay "
"shipping companies for the distance traveled, even if they end up losing "
"money. Players can research advantages, like greater shipping capacity or "
"the ability to merge companies, possibly stealing ownership of lucrative "
"plantations or shipping routes by buying out other players.<br />Players "
"keep their money hidden, trying to accumulate the most by the end of the "
"third era. When only one type of a company is left, an era ends. New eras "
"bring new cities, companies, and types of goods. At the end of the third "
"era, the player with the most money wins. However, money earned from the "
"last round of operations (selling/shipping goods) counts double, so it can "
"be important to control the timing."
msgstr ""
"《印度尼西亚》是一款 2-5 名玩家共建经济、争夺最多金钱的游戏。玩家获取生产公司"
"与航运公司，向城市运送货物。城市收到货物后会成长并提高需求。生产公司为其所在"
"城市收到的每种货物赚钱（不超过城市容量），但必须向航运公司支付里程费用，即使"
"最终亏钱。玩家可以研究优势，如更大航运容量或合并公司的能力，并可能通过收购其"
"他玩家来夺取利润丰厚的种植园或航运航线的所有权。<br />玩家隐藏自己的资金，力"
"争在第三时代结束时积累最多。当只剩一种公司时，新时代结束。新时代带来新城市、"
"新公司和新货物类型。第三时代结束时，资金最多的玩家获胜。然而，最后一轮经营"
"（销售/运输货物）所得资金翻倍，因此掌控时机很重要。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:244
msgid ""
"Build up your cities to exploit the countryside and please your chosen Saint!"
msgstr "发展你的城市，开发乡野，取悦你所选的圣人！"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:251
msgid ""
"Antiquity is a strategy game for 2-4 players. It is set in an environment "
"loosely modeled on Italy in the late Middle Ages. Players choose their own "
"victory condition: they can focus on population growth, trade, conquest, or "
"city building by choosing their patron saint.<br /><br />Each strategy "
"requires a completely different style of play. Or you can choose to adore "
"Santa Maria, the most powerful saint of all -- but you'll be expected to "
"build a civilization twice as impressive as any other player.<br /><br /"
">While your economy is constantly improving, with more and more advanced "
"cities bringing new options each turn, the land around your cities is slowly "
"being depleted, forcing you to travel further and further to gather your raw "
"materials -- until finally, there is no more land left to farm. Let's hope "
"one of you has won the game before that time!"
msgstr ""
"《中世纪》是一款 2-4 人策略游戏，背景大致以中世纪晚期的意大利为蓝本。玩家自选"
"胜利条件：通过选择守护圣人，专注于人口增长、贸易、征服或城市建设。<br /><br /"
">每种策略需要完全不同的玩法。或者你也可以选择崇拜万圣之圣 Santa Maria——但你将"
"被期待建立比任何其他玩家都壮观一倍的文明。<br /><br />随着你的经济不断改善、"
"越来越先进的城市每回合带来新选择，城市周围的土地却慢慢耗尽，迫使你走越来越远"
"去采集原料——直到最终再无可耕之地。希望在那之前你们中已有人获胜！"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:253
#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:285
#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:300
msgid ""
"Play with 2-4 people or start a practice game to play as all players on one "
"device."
msgstr "与 2-4 人游玩，或开始训练游戏在同一设备上控制所有玩家。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:260
msgid ""
"Transport as many passengers as you can - but with a time altering clock in "
"the mix, the outcome can be hard to predict!"
msgstr "尽可能多地运送乘客——但当改变时间的时钟加入后，结果可能难以预测！"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:268
msgid ""
"Beep! Beep! Bus is a game about the development of public transport in a "
"city that is expanding quickly. The citizens are busy travelling up and down "
"between their houses, the office and, most importantly: the pub. Your task "
"as a player will be to develop a busline which takes as many passengers as "
"possible to the place they want to be. You do this by expanding your "
"busline, by developing new suburbs, by luring new potential passengers to "
"the city and by investing in more and more buses. But you can also try to "
"ride just a bit earlier than other companies and steal their passengers away."
"<br /><br />Sometimes, something unexpected happens: time comes to a stand-"
"still, and all of a sudden the demand for transportation is completely "
"different... but you cannot let this happen too often, as the time-space "
"continuum will rupture and the universe will collapse, thus ending the game."
msgstr ""
"哔！哔！《巴士》是一款关于在快速扩张的城市中发展公共交通的游戏。市民们忙于往"
"返于住所、办公室，以及最重要的：酒馆。作为玩家，你的任务是发展公交线路，尽可"
"能把乘客送到他们想去的地方。你可以扩展线路、开发新郊区、吸引新乘客来到城市，"
"并投资更多巴士。你也可以设法比其他公司稍早发车，抢走他们的乘客。<br /><br />"
"有时会发生意外：时间停摆，运输需求突然完全不同……但不能让这发生得太频繁，否则"
"时空连续体将破裂、宇宙崩溃，游戏就此结束。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:276
msgid ""
"Shift your network of connections to produce and release movies in Cannes"
msgstr "调整你的关系网络，在戛纳制作并发行电影"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:283
msgid ""
"It's the big screen, and you're playing in the big league. Well, nearly. "
"Maybe this year you'll make it big… Nominations are due to be published any "
"day now, and hey, who knows, maybe you will finally get that Oscar or Palme "
"dÓr you so deserve. Or will you? They say girlie movies like you've been "
"making lately are going out of fashion, that the modern public has a "
"yearning for plotless action titles. Maybe it is time to invite that rotten "
"art critic over for drinks, and convince her of the value of your "
"masterpieces… or tune into the old boys network and really get the show on "
"the road."
msgstr ""
"这是大银幕，你正在顶级联赛打拼。嗯，差不多。也许今年你就能一举成名……提名随时"
"公布，嘿，谁知道呢，也许你终于能拿到梦寐以求的奥斯卡或金棕榈奖。会吗？他们说"
"你最近拍的那些小妞片已过时，现代观众渴望的是没有剧情的动作大片。也许是时候请"
"那位讨厌的影评人来喝一杯，让她相信你杰作的价值……或者动用老男孩网络，真正把演"
"出搞起来。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:291
msgid ""
"Connect servers up to computers to outscore and outmaneuver your opponents"
msgstr "把服务器连接到电脑上，得分并压过对手"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:298
msgid ""
"At the headoffice of Splotter-4-all computer services the phones just won't "
"stop ringing: complaints galore! Everyone wants internet. Where are the "
"connections? Web is a game in which the players attempt to connect as many "
"computers as possible. More than anyone else, at least. If that isn't "
"possible by connecting more computers yourself, there are other means. "
"Stealing computers from your neighbours, dumping uninteresting contracts on "
"them...<br />By laying cards on the table, a grid of computers and modems "
"develops. These are connected to each other by means of wooden "
"&quot;cables&quot;. Whoever connects a computer first, scores points! "
"Winning this game requires concentration, puzzling and a bit of luck."
msgstr ""
"Splotter-4-all 电脑服务总部的电话响个不停：投诉不断！人人都想要网络。连接在哪"
"里？《网络》是一款玩家尽力连接尽可能多电脑的游戏——至少要比别人多。如果自己多"
"连电脑做不到，还有别的办法：从邻居那里偷电脑，把没意思的合同甩给他们……<br />"
"把牌打到桌面上，电脑和调制解调器的网格逐渐成形。它们通过木质“电缆”相互连接。"
"谁先连上电脑，谁就得分！赢这款游戏需要专注、拼图和一点运气。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:307
msgid ""
"Bid for tiles and use actions with your workers. Build up your village to "
"achieve the highest score at the end of Winter!"
msgstr "竞价获取板块，用你的工人执行行动。建设村庄，在冬季结束时获得最高分！"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:310
msgid ""
"Published by <a href=\"https://boardgamegeek.com/boardgamepublisher/83/r-and-"
"d-games\" target=\"_blank\">R &amp; D Games</a>"
msgstr ""
"由 <a href=\"https://boardgamegeek.com/boardgamepublisher/83/r-and-d-games\" "
"target=\"_blank\">R &amp; D Games</a> 出版"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:315
msgid ""
"In spring, summer and autumn, more workers will arrive on board the "
"Keyflower and her sister boats, with some of these workers possessing skills "
"in the working of the key resources of iron, stone and wood. In each of "
"these seasons, village tiles are set out at random for auction. In the "
"winter no new workers arrive and the players select the village tiles for "
"auction from those they received at the beginning of the game. Each winter "
"village tile offers VPs for certain combinations of resources, skills and "
"workers. The player whose village and workers generate the most VPs wins the "
"game.<br /><br />Keyflower presents players with many different challenges "
"and each game will be different due to the mix of village tiles that appear "
"in that particular game. Throughout the game, players will need to be alert "
"to the opportunities to best utilize their various resources, transport and "
"upgrade capability, skills and workers."
msgstr ""
"春、夏、秋三季，更多工人会登上 大五月花号 及其姐妹船，其中一些工人掌握加工"
"铁、石、木等关键资源的技能。每个季节都会随机摆出村庄板块进行拍卖。冬季没有新"
"工人到来，玩家从开局获得的板块中选择村庄板块进行竞拍。每块冬季村庄板块为特定"
"的资源、技能与工人组合提供 VP。村庄与工人产出最多 VP 的玩家获胜。<br /><br />"
"大五月花号 给玩家带来许多不同挑战，且每局因出现的村庄板块组合不同而不同。整局"
"游戏中，玩家需要敏锐把握机会，最好地利用各种资源、运输与升级能力、技能和工"
"人。"

#: .\Lobby\templates\Lobby\index.html:317
