"里、如何抬起、资源/水放在哪里等。"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:95
msgid "How Can I Replay the Game / Copy to a New Game?"
msgstr "如何回放游戏 / 复制到新游戏？"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:104
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Select Map"
msgid "Select \\"
msgstr "选择地图"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:106
msgid ""
"You can use the on-screen arrows, or the Left / Right keyboard arrow keys to "
"step throguh the game."
msgstr "你可以使用屏幕上的箭头，或键盘左/右方向键在游戏中前后步进。"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:108
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "You can also select any entry in \"History\" to jump to that point in "
#| "time."
msgid "You can also select any entry in \\"
msgstr "你也可以在“History”中选择任意条目，跳转到该时间点。"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:110
msgid ""
"At any replay point during a player-action, you can click the \"Copy Game\" "
"button to copy the game at that point in the replay into a new Practice "
"Game. It will then be available to select in the Lobby."
msgstr ""
"在玩家行动期间的任何回放点，你可以点击“复制游戏”按钮，将回放到该点的游戏复制"
"为新的练习局。之后可在大厅中选择。"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:125
msgid "What is the difference between Rewind and Replay?"
msgstr "回退与回放有什么区别？"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:128
msgid "will literally roll the game back by one player turn."
msgstr "会将游戏回退一个玩家回合。"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:130
msgid ""
"So in the bidding phase, it will go back to the last player to make an "
"actual bid,"
msgstr "因此在竞价阶段，它会回到上一位实际竞价的玩家，"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:132
msgid ""
"or if at the first player to bid, it will rewind to the last player to take "
"actions during the last actions phase."
msgstr "或者若在第一位竞价玩家处，会回退到上一次行动阶段中最后执行行动的玩家。"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:134
msgid ""
"Similarly during actions, it will either rewind to the previous player's "
"action turn,"
msgstr "行动期间同理，要么回退到上一位玩家的行动回合，"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:135
msgid ""
"or if already at the first player, it will rewind to the last player who "
"made an actual bid."
msgstr "或者若已在第一位玩家处，会回退到最后一位实际竞价的玩家。"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:136
msgid ""
"This permanently alters the game state - once you rewind past a move, it no "
"longer exists."
msgstr "这会永久改变游戏状态 — 一旦回退越过某步，它就不存在了。"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:137
msgid "To get back to where you were, simply make the same move(s) again."
msgstr "要回到之前的状态，只需重新做出相同行动即可。"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:139
msgid ""
"does not alter the game state in any way. You can view all the moves made "
"from the start of the game, stepping through move by move, and viewing the "
"game state exactly as it was at that time."
msgstr ""
"不会以任何方式改变游戏状态。你可以从开局查看所有行动，逐步回放，并查看当时的"
"确切状态。"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:142
msgid ""
"Once you exit replay mode, the game will return to the same state as when "
"you entered replay mode."
msgstr "退出回放模式后，游戏将回到进入回放时的状态。"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:147
msgid "What is the Map Inspector?"
msgstr "地图检查器是什么？"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:157
msgid ""
"During your turn when you are not in the middle of an action, or at any "
"point during someone else's turn, you can click on the \"Map Inspector\" "
"button to enable inspection of the map."
msgstr ""
"在你的回合且不在行动中，或在其他玩家回合的任何时候，你可以点击“地图检查器”按"
"钮启用地图检查。"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:163
msgid ""
"All monuments and craftsmen will be highlighted, and you can click an item "
"to view which squares are accessible and how many hubs it requires to get "
"there."
msgstr ""
"所有纪念碑和工匠都会高亮，你可以点击物品查看哪些方格可达以及需要多少枢纽。"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:171
msgid "Where can I view available / taken items?"
msgstr "在哪里查看可用/已用物品？"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:181
msgid ""
"Click on \"Reserve\" from the top menu to view all items. Click an "
"individual player's plaque to view their items."
msgstr "点击顶部菜单的“储备”查看所有物品。点击个别玩家的铭牌查看其物品。"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:188
msgid "What is the information when bidding?"
msgstr "竞标时的信息是什么？"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:198
msgid ""
"When bidding, your bid selection (eg Bid 1) will also show how many cows you "
"would have for actions if all other players pass. This could increase if "
"bidding continues and more cows are put on on your plaque (or plaques with "
"Shadipinyi)."
msgstr ""
"竞价时，你的出价选择（如出价 1）也会显示若所有其他玩家过牌，你行动时会有多少"
"牛。若竞价继续、更多牛放到你的铭牌（或有 Shadipinyi 的铭牌）上，这个数字可能"
"增加。"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:205
msgid ""
"If you adore Elegua, eligible bids will also be marked with your total cost "
"after this bonus."
msgstr "若你崇拜 Elegua，符合条件的出价也会标注该加成后的总费用。"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:209
msgid "Why did I miss my bidding turn?"
msgstr "为什么我错过了竞标回合？"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:212
msgid ""
"Turns where you cannot do anything are skipped, For example if you do not "
"have enough cows to make an increased bid. Check the history for the reason "
"a player's turn was skipped."
msgstr ""
"无法做任何事的回合会被跳过，例如牛不够提高出价。请查看历史了解玩家回合被跳过"
"的原因。"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:221
msgid "What is the change with Dziva?"
msgstr "Dziva 有什么改动？"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:223
msgid "Dziva is considered a bit of a weak choice with the bonus as published."
msgstr "按公布规则，Dziva 的加成使其选择偏弱。"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:225
msgid ""
"Therefore, there is a small change to allow you alter prices when you choose "
"Dziva as well as at the start of your turn."
msgstr "因此有一个小改动：选择 Dziva 时以及回合开始时你都可以调整价格。"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:228
msgid ""
"There are a lot of discussions about this on BGG, and this addition has been "
"sanctioned by Splotter."
msgstr "BGG 上有很多相关讨论，这一改动也得到了 Splotter 的认可。"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:231
msgid ""
"As Dziva is a bit weak without this, and definitely not overpowered with "
"this, then there are no plans to make this a setup option."
msgstr "由于没有这一点 Dziva 略弱，加上也绝不过强，因此不打算做成设置选项。"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:233
msgid "Dziva will always have this little extra ability."
msgstr "Dziva 始终拥有这个小额外能力。"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:237
msgid "What Hotkeys are there?"
msgstr "有哪些快捷键？"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:239
msgid "R / r = Rotate"
msgstr "R / r = 旋转"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:240
msgid "Left Arrow Key = Back one step in Replay"
msgstr "左方向键 = 回放后退一步"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:241
msgid "Right Arrow Key = Forward one step in Replay"
msgstr "右方向键 = 回放前进一步"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:245
msgid "How can I score points?"
msgstr "如何得分？"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:254
msgid "You score Victory Points based on the level of each of your monuments."
msgstr "你根据每座纪念碑的等级获得胜利点数。"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:255
msgid "In addition, you get Victory Points for each Craftsman you build."
msgstr "此外，每建造一名工匠也会获得胜利点数。"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:259
msgid "Who wins? (And what about Xango?)"
msgstr "谁获胜？（Xango 呢？）"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:261
msgid "Your Victory Requirement (VR) starts at 20 points."
msgstr "你的胜利要求（VR）从 20 点开始。"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:263
msgid ""
"Taking gods, specialists, and technologies increases your VR, so you will "
"need more points to win."
msgstr "获取神、专家和技术会提高你的 VR，因此你需要更多点数才能获胜。"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:265
msgid ""
"You score Victory Points as above, giving you a score in the format VP / VR."
msgstr "你按上述方式获得胜利点数，成绩格式为 VP / VR。"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:267
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "When your VP equal or exceed your VR, you can win the game. This is "
#| "checked during the \"Let Us Compare Mythologies\" phase."
msgid ""
"When your VP equal or exceed your VR, you can win the game. This is checked "
"during the \\"
msgstr ""
"当你的 VP 等于或超过 VR 时，你就能赢得比赛。这会在“Let Us Compare "
"Mythologies”阶段进行检查。"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:270
msgid ""
"If multiple players exceed their VR in the same round (ie have more VP then "
"VR) then ties are decided as follows:"
msgstr "若多名玩家在同一轮超过 VR（即 VP 大于 VR），平局按如下规则决定："

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:274
msgid "1st tiebreaker: Highest overshoot of VR"
msgstr "第一次平局判定：VR 超出最多者"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:276
msgid "(Highest net score, once you calculate VP - VR)"
msgstr "（计算 VP - VR 后的最高净分）"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:279
msgid ""
"2nd tiebreaker: If players tie on VP - VR (ie overshoot by the same amount) "
"ties are won by Xango"
msgstr "第二次平局判定：若 VP - VR 相同（超出量相同），由 Xango 获胜"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:281
msgid "In this context, you can think of Xango as being effectively -2.5 VR"
msgstr "在此语境下，可将 Xango 视为相当于 -2.5 VR"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:284
msgid "3rd tiebreaker: Highest total VP"
msgstr "第三次平局判定：总 VP 最高者"

#: .\TGZ\templates\TGZ\TGZhelp.html:286
