#~ msgid ""
#~ "In the base game the bank only breaks once. With this module the city "
#~ "steps in the second time: the bank gets a fresh cash injection and every "
#~ "player receives a free level-2 marketing employee. The game only ends for "
#~ "good on the third break."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "基础游戏中银行只会破产一次。启用本模组后，第二次破产时城市出手：银行获得一"
#~ "笔新注资，每位玩家免费获赠一名二级营销员工。直到第三次破产游戏才真正结束。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "First break: unchanged - reserve cards are cashed in (or prices re-picked "
#~ "with the price-changing reserve cards) exactly as in the base game."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "第一次破产：照旧——储备卡按基础规则变现（启用价格重定储备卡变体则重定价"
#~ "格）。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Second break: the city bails the bank out. The bank immediately receives "
#~ "$300 per player (e.g. +$600 in a 2-player game, +$1500 with 5 players)."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "第二次破产：城市救市。银行立即获得每位玩家 $300 的注资（如 2 人局 +$600，"
#~ "5 人局 +$1500）。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The gift: on the night of the bailout, players pick one free level-2 "
#~ "marketing employee each, in turn order, first come first served: Campaign "
#~ "Manager (always), plus Rural Marketeer, Mass Marketeer, Gourmet Food "
#~ "Critic or Hawker Marketeer if the matching module is enabled in this "
#~ "game. A card that is sold out in the talent market cannot be picked; if "
#~ "nothing is left when your turn comes, you get nothing. You may also "
#~ "decline."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "赠送：救市当夜，玩家按行动顺序轮流免费挑选一名二级营销员工，先挑先得：活动"
#~ "经理（永远可选）；乡村营销员、大众营销员、美食评论家、小贩营销员则看本局是"
#~ "否启用对应模组。人才市场售罄的卡不可选；轮到你时一种都不剩则空手；也可以主"
#~ "动放弃。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The gift is not a hire: it does not trigger \"first to hire 3 employees\" "
#~ "style milestones. The employee joins your beach and is paid like any "
#~ "other employee - getting them onto the schedule and affording their "
#~ "salary is your problem. Module milestones (e.g. \"first Rural Marketeer "
#~ "used\") still trigger normally the first time you market with them."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "赠送不算雇佣：不触发「首次雇佣 3 人」类里程碑。员工进入你的休假区并像其他"
#~ "员工一样领工资——能否排班上岗、付得起工资由你自行负责。模组里程碑（如「首次"
#~ "使用乡村营销员」）在你首次派其营销时照常触发。"

#~ msgid "Third break: the game ends immediately - there is only one bailout."
#~ msgstr "第三次破产：游戏立即结束——救市只有一次。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Short games are unaffected: the first break already ends them, so the "
#~ "bailout never happens."
#~ msgstr "短局不受影响：第一次破产即终局，救市永远不会发生。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The base game's marketing is paper: billboards, mail, airplanes. This "
#~ "module adds the airwaves. A Telemarketer calls the houses right next door "
#~ "- no roads required, one call per house. A TV Announcer mounts antennas "
#~ "on five nearby roofs and owns the news: one story moves every price in "
#~ "the city by $5 tomorrow, up or down. Demand is small but surgical - the "
#~ "payoff is one perfectly stocked jackpot night that can break the bank."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "原版的广告是纸媒：广告牌、邮箱、飞机。本模组加入电波。电话推销员直接给隔壁"
#~ "的房子打电话——不需要沿路，一通电话对应一栋房。电视广播员在附近五栋房顶装上"
#~ "天线，还掌握着新闻话语权：一条报道就能让全城明晚的价格集体 +$5 或 -$5。电"
#~ "波带来的需求不多但极其精准——回报是一场备货完美的开奖之夜，足以撑爆银行。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Training chain: Marketing Trainee → Telemarketer (level 2) → TV Announcer "
#~ "(level 3) → Brand Director. Six of each; cards may be stacked."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "训练链：营销实习生 → 电话推销员（2 级）→ 电视广播员（3 级）→ 品牌总监。各 "
#~ "6 张；可以叠加持有。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Telemarketer: places 2x1 phone tokens attached to buildings (not roads) "
#~ "within one orthogonal step of your restaurant (a cross of 5 tiles). Each "
#~ "action places up to two tokens - two calls with the same food and "
#~ "duration, placed together; you may place only one. A token wedged between "
#~ "two houses reaches both. Duration 1-3 nights. The city has only 6 tokens: "
#~ "at most 6 calls on the board at once."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "电话推销员：在餐厅上下左右 1 格范围（十字 5 格）内放置 2×1 电话牌，贴着建"
#~ "筑（可不沿路）。每次行动最多放两张——两通电话，同一商品同一时长，一起下单；"
#~ "也可以只放一张。一张牌夹在两栋房之间则两栋都接到电话。持续 1~3 晚。全城共 "
#~ "6 张电话牌：同时最多 6 通电话在版。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "TV Announcer: picks exactly 5 houses within 2 steps of your restaurant (a "
#~ "diamond of 13 tiles) and mounts a rooftop antenna on each. Duration 1-4 "
#~ "nights. The city has only 2 channels: at most 2 TV campaigns at once; one "
#~ "player holding both has a monopoly."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "电视广播员：在餐厅 2 格范围（钻石 13 格）内必须选满 5 栋房，每栋房顶竖一根"
#~ "天线。持续 1~4 晚。全城仅 2 个频道：同时最多 2 个电视频道开播；一人独占两"
#~ "个频道即为垄断。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Headline (TV Announcer only, free, one per working announcer per turn): "
#~ "tomorrow night every sale in the city pays +$5 (Prime Time) or -$5 (Bad "
#~ "Press). Stories stack and cancel each other out, clamped to a city-wide "
#~ "total of +$10 or -$10."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "头条（仅电视广播员、免费、每张在班卡每回合 1 条）：明晚全城每单结算价 +$5"
#~ "（黄金档）或 -$5（负面新闻）。多条报道可叠加也可相互抵消，全城总量封顶 ±"
#~ "$10。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Timing: campaigns start pushing demand the turn after placement, like all "
#~ "campaigns. Houses keep the usual 3-demand cap; the different media push "
#~ "in a fixed order."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "时序：与所有广告战役相同，放置后的次回合开始推送需求。房屋仍遵守 3 张需求"
#~ "上限；各媒介按固定顺序推送。"

#~ msgid "Unserved orders stay on the house and may be fulfilled by anyone."
#~ msgstr "未被满足的订单留在房屋上，任何玩家都可以去满足。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Milestone \"First Telemarketer used\": unlocks a permanent group bonus - "
#~ "at Dinnertime, if every house of one of your media groups (the 2 phone "
#~ "houses or the 5 antenna houses) is served entirely by you, earn $10 per "
#~ "house ($20 per phone group, $50 per TV group; groups settle separately). "
#~ "Requires purity: no other marketing employees or campaigns of yours may "
#~ "be active that night."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "里程碑「首次使用电话推销员」：解锁永久的整组奖励——晚餐结算时，若你的某个电"
#~ "波组（电话 2 栋或天线 5 栋）全部由你一人卖出，每栋奖励 $10（电话组 $20、电"
#~ "视组 $50，多组分别结算）。要求当晚纯净：你没有其他营销员工或广告战役在班。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Milestone \"First TV Announcer used\": one-time launch bonus - during "
#~ "your first TV campaign, every antenna house gets 2 demand per night "
#~ "instead of 1."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "里程碑「首次使用电视广播员」：一次性开播奖励——你的首个电视战役期间，每栋天"
#~ "线房每晚推 2 张需求而非 1 张。"

